WEBVTT

00:30:29.273 --> 00:30:32.277
to feel a little bit
of discomfort at work.

00:30:32.301 --> 00:30:35.377
That's how people open up
and discover stuff

00:30:35.401 --> 00:30:37.316
that wouldn't otherwise have happened,

00:30:37.340 --> 00:30:41.298
and that actually, we should
be saying to people, not just,

00:30:41.322 --> 00:30:44.814
"Come and work, and should you ever
feel the tiniest twinge of discomfort,

00:30:44.838 --> 00:30:47.530
then go away and have
your own office or go work at home.

00:30:47.554 --> 00:30:49.243
But rather, saying, 'You know what?

00:30:49.267 --> 00:30:50.419
Embrace the openness

00:30:50.443 --> 00:30:52.988
because of the possibility
of serendipitous connection

00:30:53.012 --> 00:30:55.043
and what you can learn
from other employees

00:30:55.067 --> 00:30:57.234
and the team-building
and all the rest of it."

00:30:57.258 --> 00:31:00.183
Is there some level of discomfort
that's actually appropriate?